  unitName: Lich
  unitId: 60083
  unitNumber: 122
  description: A being with more magical power than all the other demons of the night.
    It overcame death through diligent magic study, and became a creature that can
    be resurrected any time it dies. According to a priest who had tried to defeat
    it, "It is not resurrected, but lives while at the same time being dead." Due
    to this, he was unable to win and lost his life at the hands of the Lich.
  summonDesc: How dare you not bow your<br>head to the Undead King?<br>You'll regret
    this...
  fusionDesc: Hehe, how wonderful.<br>You'd do well to offer<br>up more of this power.
  evoDesc: You continue to seek darkness?<br>Fine, then feel free to sink<br>into
    the dark abyss.
  element: 6
  rarity: 3
